      {"t":"type","p":"How much is this? (use यह)","a":["यह कितने का है","yah kitne kā hai"],"hint":"यह · कितना · का","x":["कितना","कितनी"],"why":"The price question is a fixed phrase: यह कितने का है?","xr":["kitnā","kitnī"]}
